OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns raised over declining
OL,4,Afish numbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn angler has raised concerns around
OL,7,FAlderney's declining fish population,
OL,8,Ffollowing the island's 38th annual
OL,9,Ffishing festival.
OL,11,FMore than 70 anglers from across the
OL,12,FBailiwick of Guernsey and the UK
OL,13,Fcompeted in the Alderney Fishing
OL,14,FFestival last week.
OL,16,FBut David Nash, a local fisherman and
OL,17,Fformer journalist, said conger, bass,
OL,18,Fmackerel, pollock, and garfish were
OL,19,F"very, very few" in number compared
OL,20,Fwith previous years.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
