OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns raised over declining
OL,4,Afish numbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe festival's committee said whilst
OL,7,Ffishing "was certainly tougher than
OL,8,Fusual", there were still some good fish
OL,9,Fcaught and populations and species
OL,10,F"seem to fluctuate from year to year".
